### Login (gateway)
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tenantId": "000000",
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin123",
  "clientId": "e5cd7e4891bf95d1d19206ce24a7b32e",
  "grantType": "password"
}

### Open tag list (no login token)
GET http://localhost:8080/music/open/tag/list

### Portal music my (needs login token)
GET http://localhost:8080/music/portal/music/my
ClientId: e5cd7e4891bf95d1d19206ce24a7b32e
Authorization: Bearer eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..H2tbfnbDnPpg5nzSkMFHgqC9MlcXXnEo-x-2PY7ZOr8

### OSS presign
POST http://localhost:8080/resource/oss/portal/presign
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

{
  "fileName": "oss_test.txt",
  "fileSize": 16,
  "contentType": "text/plain",
  "bizType": "music",
  "service": "rustfs"
}
